orelse over a field the source always has: the fallback could never apply.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	b: string
}

forward: {
	b: orelse(input.a, "x")
}
-- out/error --
0.0 always has a, so orelse's fallback could never apply: write b: input.a:
    1.0.thema:6:5
